message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EvoGen-Prompt-Evolution"
abstract: >-
  An evolutionary algorithm that optimises prompts for text-to-image
  diffusion models against an aesthetics predictor, combining Stable
  Diffusion as the generative model, the Simulacra aesthetics model as
  the fitness function, and a genetic algorithm operating over prompt
  strings.
type: software
